Subject: [PATCH 19/21] =?UTF-8?q?wallet+genesis:=20bi=20danh=20tai=20san?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20X-Chain=20theo=20BANG=20MANG=20=E2=80=94=20vi=20X/C=20song?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20lai=20tren=20g0?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

TRIEU CHUNG: nap vi chain-factory that bai ngay o buoc dau. xp-wallet — dung cong cu
runbook chi dinh — khong khoi dong duoc tren mang cong khai g0:

    khong ket noi duoc node: failed to decode client response: asset 'AVAX' not found

GOC: luot g0 doi KHOA MAP tai san trong genesis.FromConfig tu "AVAX" sang "LOVE9"
(co chu y, co chu thich). Khoa map do la BI DANH DUOC DANG KY THAT tren X-Chain. Nhung
wallet/chain/x/context.go:35 va wallet/chain/c/context.go:46 van hoi cung "AVAX", va
rebrand.sh KHONG cham hai tep do (pham vi cua no dung o 4 chuoi: Client, token Name,
token Symbol, FallbackHRP).

=> Moi cong cu dung vi X hoac C chet ngay luc mang len the he moi. Cung ho voi
FallbackHRP: ban sac song bang thu khong ai canh — nhung lan nay nguoc chieu, la
NGUOI HOI chet vi NGUOI DAT da doi ten.

VI SAO KHONG CONG NAO BAT DUOC: 9chain-a1-cli l1 create — duong de chain that su chay —
dung MakePWallet, lay assetID qua platform.getStakingAssetID, KHONG hoi bi danh. Nen
cong cu tren duong chinh van xanh trong khi duong nap tien chet cam.

SUA: mot hang, hai noi doc.
  - constants.A1AssetAlias = "LOVE9" · UpstreamAssetAlias = "AVAX"
  - constants.GetAssetAlias(networkID) quyet theo BANG (LaMangA1), dung o ca ba cho:
    genesis.FromConfig (noi DAT ten) + wallet/chain/{x,c} (noi HOI ten).
  - CO Y KHONG co nhanh du phong "thu LOVE9, hong thi thu AVAX": mot duong lui nhu the
    bien "hoi sai ten" thanh xanh va giau luon cai sai — dung lop loi /moi/ che 404 that.

NGHIEM THU (co ca DO, khong chi xanh):
  - sha256 byte genesis truoc/sau, 5 networkID:
      999999999 (g0 that) + 899999999 (tap)  -> KHOP TUNG BIT  ⇒ mang dang chay khong doi
      1 / 5 / 12345 (mainnet/fuji/local)     -> DOI            ⇒ phep so nay phan biet duoc
    (assetID khong doi o dau ca: bi danh nam trong byte genesis nhung KHONG trong assetID,
     vi assetID = ID cua CreateAssetTx, khong bao gom truong Alias.)
  - go build + go vet sach trong golang:1.25.10-bookworm.
  - TestGetAssetAlias: 11 ca, trong do 6 ca DO that (mainnet/fuji/local/ngoai bang phai
    ra "AVAX"), cong mot khang dinh hai bi danh khong duoc hoa ve mot.
  - genesis/TestAVAXAssetID: DA DO SAN 3/3 tu truoc luot nay (do rebrand Name/Symbol,
    patch 0002; tep test la ban upstream chua patch nao cham). Do o moc goc c1ef307 de
    doi chung — luot nay khong lam no xau di, va ba gia tri "actual" khong doi.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
